<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n14176" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄπους</span></b> , ὁ, ἡ, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πουν</span>, τό, gen. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οδος</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>without foot</i> or
				<i>feet,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Phdr.</u>
				264c
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				487a23
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Corn.
				<u>ND</u>
				16
			</span></i>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>without the use of one's feet, lame,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Ph.</u>
				632
			</span></i>; <i>bad of foot,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κύνες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Cyn.</u>
					3.3
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κακόποδες οἳ διὰ τοῦτο καλοῦνται
					ἄποδες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>HA</u>
					487b24
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Metaph.</u>
				1022b35
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>de An.</u>
				422a29
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> as
				Subst., 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κύψελος</span>
			, <i>sand-martin, Hirundo riparia;</i> possibly also, <i>the
				swift, Cypselus apus,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>HA</u>
				618a31
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
